{"seq":12,"slug":"on-correctly-handling-contradictions","title":"关于正确处理人民内部矛盾的问题","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":4,"docCount":10,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/12_on-correctly-handling-contradictions","introMarkdown":"# 关于正确处理人民内部矛盾的问题 简介\n\n《关于正确处理人民内部矛盾的问题》是毛泽东于一九五七年二月在最高国务会议第十一次（扩大）会议上的讲话，经整理后于同年六月正式发表。这篇著作首次系统提出了社会主义社会基本矛盾的理论，创造性地将社会主义条件下的矛盾区分为敌我矛盾和人民内部矛盾两类不同性质的矛盾，并提出了用不同方法处理不同性质矛盾的基本原则，是马克思主义国家学说和社会主义建设理论的重大发展。\n\n本知识库适用于希望深入理解社会主义矛盾理论与治理方法的读者，无论是马克思主义理论研究者、公共管理学习者，还是对国家治理逻辑与社会矛盾化解感兴趣的一般读者，都能从中获得系统的理论认知和方法论启发。\n\n第一章**理论框架**，从两类不同性质矛盾的根本区分出发，阐明敌我矛盾与人民内部矛盾在性质、处理方法上的本质差异，还原百花运动的历史背景与思想语境，并探讨这一理论与《矛盾论》之间的内在理论联结与延伸发展。\n\n第二章**具体矛盾分析**，深入剖析社会主义建设中工农矛盾与城乡关系的结构性张力，论述知识分子问题与教育方针的政策逻辑，并分析少数民族问题中民族团结与区域自治的矛盾处理原则。\n\n第三章**解决方法**，系统阐述\"团结—批评—团结\"这一处理人民内部矛盾的基本公式及其方法论内涵，并深入分析民主集中制作为组织原则在矛盾调和与决策中的制度功能。\n\n第四章**历史影响**，从社会主义治理创新的角度评价这篇著作对国家治理理论的独特贡献，进而探讨其矛盾化解思想对当代社会治理实践的持续启示意义。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先通读第一章建立两类矛盾区分的理论框架，再通过第二章理解具体矛盾的多维分析方法，继而在第三章中掌握矛盾解决的制度工具与方法论，最后在第四章中完成对这一理论的历史定位与现实价值的整体把握。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-framework","title":"理论框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/theoretical-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-types-contradictions","title":"两类不同性质的矛盾","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/theoretical-framework/two-types-contradictions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-context-hundred-flowers","title":"历史背景与百花运动","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/theoretical-framework/historical-context-hundred-flowers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dialectical-method-extension","title":"矛盾论的延伸发展","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/theoretical-framework/dialectical-method-extension"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"specific-contradictions","title":"具体矛盾分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/specific-contradictions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"worker-peasant-contradictions","title":"工农矛盾与城乡关系","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/specific-contradictions/worker-peasant-contradictions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"intellectuals-education-policy","title":"知识分子与教育方针","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/specific-contradictions/intellectuals-education-policy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"minority-nationalities-issues","title":"少数民族问题","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/specific-contradictions/minority-nationalities-issues"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"resolution-methods","title":"解决方法","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/resolution-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unity-criticism-unity-formula","title":"团结—批评—团结公式","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/resolution-methods/unity-criticism-unity-formula"},{"seq":2,"slug":"democratic-centralism-approach","title":"民主集中制方法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/resolution-methods/democratic-centralism-approach"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"historical-impact","title":"历史影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/historical-impact","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"socialist-governance-innovation","title":"社会主义治理创新","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/historical-impact/socialist-governance-innovation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contemporary-conflict-resolution","title":"当代矛盾化解启示","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-correctly-handling-contradictions/historical-impact/contemporary-conflict-resolution"}]}]}